have in this country.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.080
It's not a great percentage.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:14:00.060
So hopefully this is really good work, actually,
by Frank Luntz.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.120
Hopefully this helps us to understand the
issue.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:06.730
And the more we understand it, the more of
a shot we have at fixing it.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:11.180
And we'll be talking more in the coming weeks
about how it can maybe be fixed.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:14.450
But as you can see, that's an uphill battle.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.450
That's a real uphill battle.

